  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.ConvexOASIS v2.0.3\n\nConvex OASIS Provider — real-time serverless database for OASIS holons and avatars via Convex HTTP API. No SDK required — uses System.Net.Http. https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- Enable verified Convex response deadlines and readiness recovery (76c6ead)\n- feat: implement native Convex companion and verify S3 storage family (4627976)\n- fix: validate Convex function envelopes and admin authentication (020597b)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n- Validate GUID native keys before avatar deletion in forty adapters (597758b)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Cloud/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.ConvexOASIS",
